@base = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Look at the RESPONSE HEADERS. Expect:
###    content-security-policy, x-content-type-options: nosniff,
###    strict-transport-security, referrer-policy, and NO x-powered-by.
###    Also a RateLimit header (your remaining quota)
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Allowed origin. Expect access-control-allow-origin: http://localhost:5500
GET {{base}}/products?limit=1
Origin: http://localhost:5500

### 3. Evil origin. Expect 200 but NO access-control-allow-origin header
###    (a browser would refuse to show this page's script the response)
GET {{base}}/products?limit=1
Origin: https://evil.example

### 4. Preflight for DELETE from an allowed origin. Expect 204 with
###    access-control-allow-methods and access-control-allow-headers
OPTIONS {{base}}/products/000000000000000000000000
Origin: http://localhost:5500
Access-Control-Request-Method: DELETE
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization

### 5. Preflight from an evil origin. Expect NO access-control-allow-* headers
OPTIONS {{base}}/products/000000000000000000000000
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: DELETE

### 6. Operator injection through the query string. Expect a normal list (200),
###    not an error and not a filtered/leaked result
GET {{base}}/products?owner[$ne]=nobody&category[$ne]=x

### 7. Operator injection through a JSON body. Expect 400 (we only accept strings)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": { "$gt": "" }, "password": { "$gt": "" } }

### 8. Log in so we can try a stored-XSS payload
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "mika_beauty", "password": "Password123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 9. Script-like text in a product name. Expect 201, stored EXACTLY as typed.
###    The server stores text as text. The frontend's escapeHtml (and the CSP) handle display
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>",
  "brand": "XSS Test",
  "category": "makeup",
  "origin": "local",
  "price": 99,
  "description": "<script>alert('xss')</script> test description",
  "links": [{ "platform": "shopee", "url": "https://shopee.ph/xss-test" }]
}

### 10. A link that is NOT on an approved domain. Expect 400
POST {{base}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Phishing Test",
  "brand": "Test",
  "category": "makeup",
  "origin": "local",
  "price": 99,
  "description": "Checking that bad links are refused.",
  "links": [{ "platform": "shopee", "url": "javascript:alert(1)" }]
}

### 11. Absurd page size is refused. Expect 400
GET {{base}}/products?limit=100000